	"Description": "This mod replaces the portraits and sprites of some villagers to make them cuter.\n<br />I used to release this mod on the Chucklefish Forums. I decided to release it here as well for more exposure.\u00A0\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />[b]Villagers included: Dwarf, Evelyn, Jas, Krobus, Linus, Pam, Sandy, Vincent and Wizard.\n<br />**Note: I didn't do new sprites for Pam and Sandy and have no plan to do so :)\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />[/b]I will continue to update this mod. So stay tune!\u00A0\n<br />If you found any bugs/problem, feel free to contact me.\n<br />If you want me to do any villager in particular, also feel free to leave a comment.\n<br />[b]**Note: I'm not sure if I should do the\u00A0marriageable characters. There have been incidents where people verbally attack me for being a pedophile due to my art style.\u00A0[/b]",
